  "prompt_en": "Professional food photography of a hearty vegetable soup in a rustic ceramic bowl, featuring perfectly diced tender potatoes, vibrant carrot slices, and translucent onion pieces in a clear, savory broth. Garnished with a drizzle of golden olive oil on top. Styled with raw ingredients subtly placed in the background including a whole potato, a fresh carrot, and a peeled onion. Shot at a 45-degree angle, shallow depth of field, soft natural window light casting gentle shadows, warm cozy home kitchen ambiance, cinematic food styling, ultra-detailed, 8k resolution, photorealistic. No text, no logos, no people, no unrelated elements.",
